# MCP server README Template

**REQUIRED — every MCP server must include a `README.md` at the app root. Absence of `README.md` is a blocking issue. Do not mark the app as complete without it.**

## Structure (Platform 3.0 MCP server)

```markdown
# [App Name]

A Freshworks marketplace MCP server for [integration/service].

## Features

- **[Action 1]** - Brief description
- **[Action 2]** - Brief description
- **[Authentication]** - e.g., Bearer Token, OAuth

## Setup

1. Install the app in your Freshworks product
2. Configure credentials in app settings:
   - [List iparams: API Key, Base URL, etc.]

## Tools

- `actionName1` - Description
- `actionName2` - Description

## Testing

cd <app-directory>
fdk run

Configure locally: http://localhost:10001/custom_configs
Execute locally: https://localhost:10001/web/test (select type "actions", then test each action)
```

## Rules

- Keep concise
- List all actions with function names
- Include setup steps for iparams
- Add testing instructions (`fdk run`, configure locally, execute locally)
